  "resolution_html": "<ol start=\"1\">\n<li><strong>Install Mozilla Thunderbird</strong>: </li>\n</ol>\n<ul>\n<li>Download and install <strong>Mozilla Thunderbird</strong> (a free email client)</li>\n</ul>\n<ol start=\"2\">\n<li><strong>Add Your Outlook Account</strong>: </li>\n</ol>\n<ul>\n<li>In Thunderbird, go to <strong>Account Settings</strong> &gt; <strong>Add Mail Account</strong>, and enter your Outlook credentials (you may need to enable IMAP in your Outlook settings)</li>\n</ul>\n<ol start=\"3\">\n<li><strong>Sync Your Emails</strong>: </li>\n</ol>\n<ul>\n<li>Wait for Thunderbird to sync all your emails</li>\n</ul>\n<ol start=\"4\">\n<li><strong>Save or Backup Emails</strong>: </li>\n</ol>\n<ul>\n<li>Once synced, you can either manually save the emails to your computer or use extensions like <strong>ImportExportTools NG</strong> to export all emails in one go</li>\n</ul>",
